  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "50148829",
      "title": "RAG - A Closer Look",
      "sourceHash": "f2687ac319c5035fd46dcd8190b992c58a41aa94befdb12938475d1d9d061a86",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.599,
          "end": 3.339,
          "en": "So this CAG workflow is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.819,
          "end": 6.339,
          "en": "quite straightforward to set up and quite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.379,
          "end": 9.179,
          "en": "powerful because it allows us to ask questions about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.179,
          "end": 12.139,
          "en": "data that otherwise would be unknown to the AI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.699,
          "end": 15.5,
          "en": "Now, I also mentioned that you could alternatively",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.559,
          "end": 18.12,
          "en": "also set up a RAG workflow, which is about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.139,
          "end": 20.739,
          "en": "retrieving relevant data. So the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.779,
          "end": 23.72,
          "en": "idea still is that you have some user input, some chat, and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.76,
          "end": 26.7,
          "en": "again, it could be a predefined, uh, user input if it's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.7,
          "end": 28.819,
          "en": "a daily script or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.359,
          "end": 31.819,
          "en": "And based on that input, you got some prompt, some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.899,
          "end": 34.139,
          "en": "question about data, typically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.719,
          "end": 37.319,
          "en": "data that's not built into the AI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.02,
          "end": 40.979,
          "en": "Now with a RAG workflow, the setup gets a bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41,
          "end": 43.699,
          "en": "more complex because in a RAG workflow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.02,
          "end": 46.939,
          "en": "we typically include something that's called a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.099,
          "end": 50.079,
          "en": "vector database. And such a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.119,
          "end": 52.779,
          "en": "database stores vector embeddings and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53,
          "end": 55.56,
          "en": "metadata. And what's that? What are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.68,
          "end": 58.199,
          "en": "vector embeddings? Well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.559,
          "end": 61.539,
          "en": "the idea behind this RAG workflow is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.559,
          "end": 63.739,
          "en": "that we try to semantically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.739,
          "end": 66.679,
          "en": "understand the question asked by",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.679,
          "end": 69.26,
          "en": "the user. So if the user's question is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.559,
          "end": 72.07900000000001,
          "en": "where is Eva working? We wanna",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.07900000000001,
          "end": 74.879,
          "en": "understand that it's about Eva and that it's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.879,
          "end": 77.65899999999999,
          "en": "about the department where she's working, even though the word",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.76,
          "end": 80.599,
          "en": "department maybe did not show up in the prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.619,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "Now, that's where so-called vector embeddings can help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.619,
          "end": 86.779,
          "en": "us because that's a numeric",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.85900000000001,
          "end": 89.52,
          "en": "representation of text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.84,
          "end": 92.82,
          "en": "that's able to reflect semantic meaning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.86,
          "end": 95.619,
          "en": "The idea simply is that some text gets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.65899999999999,
          "end": 98.399,
          "en": "converted to numbers and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.799,
          "end": 101.57900000000001,
          "en": "the vector embedding of the question,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.759,
          "end": 104.459,
          "en": "where's Eva working? Would look something like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.479,
          "end": 107.02000000000001,
          "en": "this, for example. And those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.07900000000001,
          "end": 108.85900000000001,
          "en": "numbers actually built an",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.919,
          "end": 111.779,
          "en": "N-dimensional vector. So they point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.84,
          "end": 114.279,
          "en": "at some place in a N-dimensional",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 116.44,
          "en": "space where this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.939,
          "end": 119.319,
          "en": "phrase, this sentence would belong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.319,
          "end": 121.899,
          "en": "Now why does this matter? Because we also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.979,
          "end": 124.619,
          "en": "store all our employee information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.079,
          "end": 127.839,
          "en": "in such a N-dimensional space, and that's where the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.839,
          "end": 130.779,
          "en": "vector database comes in because that's the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.839,
          "end": 132.839,
          "en": "where that information gets stored.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.499,
          "end": 136.219,
          "en": "So we would also take all the employee information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.739,
          "end": 139.239,
          "en": "and for every employee build a short",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.47899999999998,
          "end": 141.959,
          "en": "sentence that reflects the key information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.379,
          "end": 145.059,
          "en": "about this employee. So we might have something like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.099,
          "end": 147.179,
          "en": "name, Eva, department, HR,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.079,
          "end": 150.939,
          "en": "and convert that to a vector embedding as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.999,
          "end": 153.839,
          "en": "with the same mechanism we used for converting the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.879,
          "end": 155.839,
          "en": "user prompt to a vector embedding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 156.859,
          "end": 159.659,
          "en": "And then this vector embedding for the employee",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.839,
          "end": 161.91899999999998,
          "en": "gets stored in such a vector database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.999,
          "end": 164.959,
          "en": "So that vector database holds a bunch of embeddings in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.279,
          "end": 169.199,
          "en": "The idea now is that we can now use the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.299,
          "end": 172.119,
          "en": "vector embedding that was built for our user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.219,
          "end": 174.879,
          "en": "prompt with help of something called an embedding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.179,
          "end": 178.079,
          "en": "model, which is simply a model that produces such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.119,
          "end": 180.939,
          "en": "vector embeddings, which we also use for creating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.979,
          "end": 182.759,
          "en": "the embeddings we store in the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.959,
          "end": 186.679,
          "en": "And we send the vector embedding that was built",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.719,
          "end": 188.879,
          "en": "for the user prompt we received here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 189.319,
          "end": 192.279,
          "en": "to the vector database. And then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.319,
          "end": 194.619,
          "en": "that vector database is able to take that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 194.959,
          "end": 197.899,
          "en": "received embedding for the user prompt and compare",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.919,
          "end": 200.579,
          "en": "it to the stored embeddings and find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.579,
          "end": 203.419,
          "en": "which stored embeddings are closest",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.47899999999998,
          "end": 206.279,
          "en": "to the received ones. So if we're asking about Eva and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 206.299,
          "end": 209.019,
          "en": "where she's working, that will give us an",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.019,
          "end": 211.319,
          "en": "embedding that points to some place in that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.459,
          "end": 214.199,
          "en": "N-dimensional space that's close",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.519,
          "end": 217.47899999999998,
          "en": "to the stored record about Eva and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.599,
          "end": 220.039,
          "en": "that she's working in the HR department.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 221.039,
          "end": 223.75900000000001,
          "en": "And therefore, the vector database will make that comparison and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 223.799,
          "end": 226.31900000000002,
          "en": "return the data that's most",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.41899999999998,
          "end": 229.139,
          "en": "likely related or that's closest to the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.219,
          "end": 232.159,
          "en": "user prompt. And that can be one or multiple records",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.199,
          "end": 233.959,
          "en": "that are returned in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.219,
          "end": 237.859,
          "en": "and that's then the retrieved data that's injected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.299,
          "end": 240.999,
          "en": "into the user prompt like before with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.079,
          "end": 243.779,
          "en": "CAG. But the difference is that we're working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 244.179,
          "end": 247.079,
          "en": "typically working with such vector embeddings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.299,
          "end": 249.97899999999998,
          "en": "and that we find the most likely related",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 250.039,
          "end": 252.919,
          "en": "data based on such embeddings. And that's also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 252.959,
          "end": 255.859,
          "en": "why this workflow is a bit more complex to set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 255.899,
          "end": 258.519,
          "en": "up because we need to deal with those embeddings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 258.519,
          "end": 260.959,
          "en": "We need to create them, we need to set up such a vector",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 261.039,
          "end": 262.859,
          "en": "database and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 263.959,
          "end": 266.759,
          "en": "Now, what we get back by that vector database, by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 267.119,
          "end": 269.419,
          "en": "is not typically the raw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 269.499,
          "end": 272.299,
          "en": "embedding that would not be very readable for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 272.319,
          "end": 274.859,
          "en": "us humans, but instead it would be that stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 275.019,
          "end": 277.779,
          "en": "metadata, for example, which is either the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 277.819,
          "end": 280.399,
          "en": "actual employee data we might be looking for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 280.659,
          "end": 283.599,
          "en": "or maybe it's the ID of the employee. And",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 283.619,
          "end": 286.479,
          "en": "we could then use that to reach out to another database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 286.799,
          "end": 289.519,
          "en": "that might then hold the actual employee data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 290.619,
          "end": 293.479,
          "en": "depending on the complexity of the data and the complexity of our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 293.479,
          "end": 296.419,
          "en": "setup. In the easiest form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 296.439,
          "end": 298.979,
          "en": "in the simplest way, we would have all the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 299.279,
          "end": 302.159,
          "en": "employee data attached to the related vector",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 302.199,
          "end": 304.999,
          "en": "embedding as metadata in the vector database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 305.039,
          "end": 307.879,
          "en": "But we could also use the vector database as an in-between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 307.939,
          "end": 310.819,
          "en": "step to then reach out to yet another data store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 311.119,
          "end": 313.979,
          "en": "and get the actual data from there. That would also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 313.999,
          "end": 316.879,
          "en": "be possible, but in its simplest form, it would look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 316.899,
          "end": 319.799,
          "en": "like this. And then again, we send the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 319.879,
          "end": 322.519,
          "en": "augmented prompt to an AI model and we get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 322.519,
          "end": 325.399,
          "en": "back the final response just like before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 325.879,
          "end": 328.159,
          "en": "Now let's take a look at that in practice.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
      "lectureOrder": 280,
      "videoOrder": 280
    }
  ],
